# ============================================================
# COMPANY FORK ISOLATION — v1.6.2+
# ============================================================
# Company-specific source files exist in Codeup but MUST NOT
# appear in this public GitHub mirror.
#
# Rule: any file under client/src/company/ is company-internal.
# The Cargo feature "company" gates all compilation of these files.
# Disabling the feature (default) means GitHub builds compile fine
# even though the source files don't exist here.
# ============================================================
client/src/company/
server-java/src/main/java/com/aitrack/server/company/
server-go/internal/company/
